"Software" means the Spectral Core source code and accompanying materials
identified by the project rights holder as being offered under this License.

"Personal Non-Commercial Use" means use by an individual for private,
personal, educational, hobby, or non-commercial research purposes, where
the Software is not used to provide goods or services for payment, operate a
business or commercial service, or support the commercial operations of an
